    <entry>
      <title>CMake基础教程(四)：项目文件结构</title>
      <link href="/2026/02/15/cmake_tutorial/cmake_4/"/>
      <url>/2026/02/15/cmake_tutorial/cmake_4/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="一个常用的结构模板"><a href="#一个常用的结构模板" class="headerlink" title="一个常用的结构模板"></a>一个常用的结构模板</h1><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">├─bin</span><br><span class="line">├─build</span><br><span class="line">├─include</span><br><span class="line">├─lib</span><br><span class="line">├─src</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─Module1</span><br><span class="line">│  │  ├─module1.hpp</span><br><span class="line">│  │  └─module1.cpp</span><br><span class="line">│  ├─main.cpp</span><br><span class="line">│  └─CMakelists.txt</span><br><span class="line">└─CMakelists.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>最外层的 <code>CMakelists.txt</code> 是主 CMake 文件，我们在里面定义一些项目的参数<br>例如：</p><ul><li>最低 CMake 兼容版本</li><li>项目名称、所用编程语言</li><li>输出路径、引用路径</li><li>…<figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">cmake_minimum_required</span>(VERSION <span class="number">3.23</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">project</span>(MyProjectName LANGUAGES CXX)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span>(EXECUTABLE_OUTPUT_PATH <span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/bin)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span>(LIBRARY_OUTPUT_PATH <span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/lib)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">include_directories</span>(<span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/<span class="keyword">include</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">link_directories</span>(<span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/lib)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">add_subdirectory</span>(src)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><code>add_subdirectory(src)</code> 可以引用一个/多个子文件夹，其中里面必须包含一个 <code>CMakelists.txt</code>，并继承当前 <code>CMakelists.txt</code> (使用 <code>add_subdirectory(src)</code> 的那一个)的参数</li></ul><blockquote><p>其他参数可以参考<a href="https://whitemozj.github.io/2026/02/14/cmake_tutorial/cmake_3/">上一集</a></p></blockquote><p>子文件夹里的 <code>CMakelists.txt</code> 主要是构建当前文件夹下的模块，例如添加一个可执行文件等：<br><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">add_executable</span>(hello <span class="string">&quot;main.cpp&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">add_library</span>(module1 SHARED</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;module1.hpp&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;module1.cpp&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">file</span> (GLOB_RECURSE </span><br><span class="line">      DLL_FILES</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">&quot;$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;/lib/*.dll&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">add_custom_command</span>(<span class="keyword">TARGET</span> hello POST_BUILD</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">COMMAND</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;CMAKE_COMMAND&#125;</span> -E copy</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable">$&#123;DLL_FILES&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">        $&lt;TARGET_FILE_DIR:hello&gt;</span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">target_link_libraries</span>(main module1)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>此处参考了<a href="https://whitemozj.github.io/2026/02/14/cmake_tutorial/cmake_3/">上一集</a>的构建内容</p><h1 id="如何引用他人的头文件和库"><a href="#如何引用他人的头文件和库" class="headerlink" title="如何引用他人的头文件和库"></a>如何引用他人的头文件和库</h1><p>新建 <code>include</code> 和 <code>lib</code> 是为了更好的引用他人/自己的头文件和库</p><p>大部分时候有些开源库需要自己编译，然后把我们需要的头文件和库分别拷贝到当前项目中的<code>include</code> 和 <code>lib</code> 下就可以使用</p><blockquote><p>虽然CMake提供了例如 <code>find_package()</code> 这类可以从系统变量里搜索，但是需要对支持 CMake 编译安装的库有效(包含 <code>Find&lt;LibraryName&gt;.cmake</code> 或 <code>&lt;LibraryName&gt;Config.cmake</code>)</p></blockquote><p>如果把项目移植到另一台主机上，只需要安装相同的编译环境(Visual C++、MinGW、Ninja…)就可以直接使用</p><h1 id="最后"><a href="#最后" class="headerlink" title="最后"></a>最后</h1><p>当然所有建议仅供参考，<strong>最最最重要</strong>的是需要<em>建立一个自己习惯、甚至是整个团队约定的工作流</em>，尽可能避免自己的项目变成<strong><em>屎山代码</em></strong></p>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> CMake </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> CMake </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>CMake基础教程(三)：连接世界————构建链接库</title>
      <link href="/2026/02/15/cmake_tutorial/cmake_3/"/>
      <url>/2026/02/15/cmake_tutorial/cmake_3/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>与构建可执行文件类似，CMake也有可以构建链接库</p><p>但再次之前，我们需要定义几个参数，来让文件结构看起来更优雅：<br><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span>(EXECUTABLE_OUTPUT_PATH <span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/bin)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span>(LIBRARY_OUTPUT_PATH <span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/lib)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">include_directories</span>(<span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/<span class="keyword">include</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">link_directories</span>(<span class="variable">$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;</span>/lib)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><ul><li><code>${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}</code> 是最近使用 <code>project</code> 的 <code>CMakelist.txt</code> 所在的路径，在此情况下也可以使用 <code>${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}</code>(主 <code>CMakelist.txt</code> 所在的路径)</li><li><code>set(EXECUTABLE_OUTPUT_PATH ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/bin)</code> 和 <code>set(LIBRARY_OUTPUT_PATH ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/lib)</code> 是分别指定<strong>可执行文件和链接库输出的路径</strong>，这样就可以不用每次都在 build 文件夹下生成了</li><li><code>include_directories(${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/include)</code> 和 <code>link_directories(${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/lib)</code> 分别指定项目去哪找<strong>头文件和链接库</strong></li></ul><blockquote><p>使用 <code>include_directories</code> 指定之后的头文件可以和引用系统头文件一样使用 <code>#include &lt;xx.h&gt;</code> 而不用再使用 <code>#include &quot;path/xx.h</code></p></blockquote><h1 id="构建一个链接库"><a href="#构建一个链接库" class="headerlink" title="构建一个链接库"></a>构建一个链接库</h1><p>首先我们先定义一个类<br><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// cal.hpp</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">ifndef</span> CAL_HPP</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">define</span> CAL_HPP</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">Calculator</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">Calculator</span>();</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">add</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x, <span class="type">int</span> y)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">endif</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// cal.cpp</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&quot;cal.hpp&quot;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Calculator::<span class="built_in">Calculator</span>()</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">Calculator::add</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x, <span class="type">int</span> y)</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> x + y;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><h2 id="静态链接库"><a href="#静态链接库" class="headerlink" title="静态链接库"></a>静态链接库</h2><p>静态链接库是在编译可执行文件之前与可执行文件链接的库，在运行时不需要参与执行</p><p>使用 <code>STATIC</code> 参数指定编译为静态链接库，或者留空默认为静态链接库<br><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">add_library</span>(cal STATIC</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;cal.hpp&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;cal.cpp&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><blockquote><p><code>add_library</code> 和 <code>add_executable</code> 一样都可以先指定名称，在使用 <code>target_sources</code> 指定文件，不过对于小项目来说相对繁琐，详细可以参考<a href="https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/command/target_sources.html">这里</a></p></blockquote><p>修改主文件<br><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// hello.cpp</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&quot;cal.hpp&quot;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    Calculator calculator;</span><br><span class="line">    std::cout &lt;&lt; calculator.<span class="built_in">add</span>(<span class="number">10</span>, <span class="number">1</span>) &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>为主文件链接库(在 <code>add_executable</code> 之后添加)：<br><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">target_link_libraries</span>(hello cal)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br><code>target_link_libraries</code> 会自动识别链接库是静态还是动态</p><blockquote><p>其实之前的主文件修改方式即使不构建链接库，直接为 <code>add_executable</code> 添加文件也能运行(尝试注释掉 <code>add_library</code> 相关文本并删除 <code>cal.cpp</code>)，但是往往我们需要用到其他人写的库或者模块化移植自己的代码都需要使用到链接库</p><p>之后我会在关于 CMake 项目文件结构在探讨这类问题：关于如何优雅使用头文件和库</p></blockquote><h2 id="动态链接库"><a href="#动态链接库" class="headerlink" title="动态链接库"></a>动态链接库</h2><p>动态链接库在程序运行时才会链接，这样可以缩小可执行文件的大小，并且可以在不同的可执行文件重复调用动态链接库，提高复用性</p><p>程序运行时会在<strong>程序所在文件夹以及其子文件夹</strong>或者<strong>系统变量指定的文件夹</strong>(例如 Linux 系统下的 <code>LD_LIBRARY_PATH</code> 变量)寻找动态链接库</p><blockquote><p>但是Windows对于动态链接库管理相对混乱，有时会出现动态链接库引用冲突(系统变量里存在两个同名但不同版本的 dll 文件)，所以在<a href="https://whitemozj.github.io/2026/02/14/cmake_tutorial/cmake_3/">第一集</a>提到了使用 <code>set(CMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS &quot;-static&quot;)</code> 相对比较简单粗暴的方法</p><p>后来我排查了以下，可能是由于之前修理其他链接库的问题，C:\Windows\System32 下的<code>libstc++-6.dll</code> 有些问题，删除之后不使用 <code>set(CMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS &quot;-static&quot;)</code> 也可以正常运行</p></blockquote><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">add_library</span>(cal SHARED</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;cal.hpp&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;cal.cpp&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>显式声明 <code>SHARED</code> 编译动态链接库，与静态链接库一样，使用 <code>target_link_libraries</code> 与可执行文件链接</p><p>如果你没有添加 <code>set(EXECUTABLE_OUTPUT_PATH ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/bin)</code> 和 <code>set(LIBRARY_OUTPUT_PATH ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/lib)</code> 那么程序就能够正常运行，因为可执行文件和库文件都在 build 文件夹下</p><p>但是添加之后就会无法启动，原因是可执行文件在 bin 文件夹下，动态链接库在 lib 文件夹，所以我们需要执行一次<strong>复制</strong>:<br><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">file</span> (GLOB_RECURSE </span><br><span class="line">      DLL_FILES</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">&quot;$&#123;PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR&#125;/lib/*.dll&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">add_custom_command</span>(<span class="keyword">TARGET</span> hello POST_BUILD</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">COMMAND</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;CMAKE_COMMAND&#125;</span> -E copy</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable">$&#123;DLL_FILES&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">        $&lt;TARGET_FILE_DIR:hello&gt;</span><br><span class="line">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>对比一下使用动态/静态链接库的 hello.exe 的文件大小</p><ul><li>使用动态链接库 hello.exe: 68KB + libcal.dll: 40KB</li><li>使用静态链接库 hello.exe: 81KB</li></ul><p>似乎是静态链接库更小一点，但不要忘了动态链接库的复用性，一个动态链接库可以当作多个静态链接库来使用</p>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> CMake </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> CMake </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>CMake基础教程(二)：如何在 Visual Studio Code 上优雅地配置CMake</title>
      <link href="/2026/02/14/cmake_tutorial/cmake_2/"/>
      <url>/2026/02/14/cmake_tutorial/cmake_2/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="你需要用到的插件"><a href="#你需要用到的插件" class="headerlink" title="你需要用到的插件"></a>你需要用到的插件</h1><p>在 Extensions 中搜索’cmake’就能找到以下插件</p><p><img src="images/image2-1.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>前两个是我们主要所需要的，其他插件可按需下载</p><h1 id="配置"><a href="#配置" class="headerlink" title="配置"></a>配置</h1><p>安装后如果使用 VSCode 打开包含 <code>CMakelists.txt</code> 的文件夹时，上方会自动弹出选项</p><p><img src="images/image2-2.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>或者输入 <code>&gt;cmake:quick start</code> 并点击</p><p><img src="images/image2-3.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>同样也会创建 CMake 配置，且当不存在 <code>CMakelists.txt</code> 会自动创建一个</p><p>选择我们需要用的编译器，此时基本已经<strong>创建完成</strong>，并会生成 <strong>build</strong> 文件夹，文件夹下面是构建出的临时文件和可执行文件等</p><p>左下角有三个按键：</p><p><img src="images/image2-4.png" alt="alt text"></p><p>分别为 <strong>构建(Build)</strong>、<strong>Debug</strong>、<strong>运行(Run)</strong></p><ul><li>构建(Build)是将代码使用CMake构建成可执行文件</li><li>Debug用于进行测试</li><li>运行(Run)则是运行可执行文件，当我们代码在上次构建之后有修改过，会自动执行一次构建并运行</li></ul><p>如果再次输入 <code>&gt;cmake:quick start</code>，便会创建一个 present，选择编译器，输入 present 的名称，便会生成一个 <code>CMakePersents.json</code>，默认内容如下：<br><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">&quot;version&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">8</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">&quot;configurePresets&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;cmake_learn&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;displayName&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;GCC 15.2.0 x86_64-w64-mingw32&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;description&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;Using compilers: C = P:\\mingw64\\bin\\gcc.exe, CXX = P:\\mingw64\\bin\\g++.exe&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;generator&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;MinGW Makefiles&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;binaryDir&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;$&#123;sourceDir&#125;/out/build/$&#123;presetName&#125;&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="attr">&quot;cacheVariables&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;$&#123;sourceDir&#125;/out/install/$&#123;presetName&#125;&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_C_COMPILER&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;P:/mingw64/bin/gcc.exe&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;P:/mingw64/bin/g++.exe&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="attr">&quot;CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;Debug&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p><ul><li><code>&quot;generator&quot;</code>：所使用的生成器</li><li><code>&quot;binaryDir&quot;</code>：构建所生成文件的路径</li><li><code>&quot;cacheVariables&quot;</code>：运行 CMake 所用的参数</li></ul><p>这里建议将 <code>&quot;binaryDir&quot;</code> 改为 <code>&quot;${sourceDir}/build&quot;</code>，以及将 <code>&quot;CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX&quot;</code> 改为 <code>&quot;${sourceDir}/install&quot;</code></p><p>CLion (<em><a href="https://blog.jetbrains.com/clion/2025/05/clion-is-now-free-for-non-commercial-use/">CLion 去年对非商用途人群免费了</a></em>)等 IDE (集成开发环境)可以从创建项目的页面中创建 CMake 项目并更改需要的参数，但我更偏向于使用 VSCode 这类‘<strong>文本编辑器</strong>’，它更快，更轻便，缺点是有些东西可能需要折腾一阵子</p><p>但话说回来：<strong>萝卜青菜，各有所爱</strong></p>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> CMake </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> CMake </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
